# TASKS.md — CloudDesk Project 1 Task List

Derived from `CLAUDE.md` §19 phase plan and `PLAN.md` requirement catalog. Each task maps to a PRD row (F1–F14, N1–N8) and a phase. Check off as completed.

## Phase 1 — Runtime skeleton (Requires: F14, N3)

| ID | Task | PRD Rows | Status |
|----|------|----------|--------|
| 1.1 | Create `backend/app/core/config.py` with `get_settings()` | F14 | ✅ |
| 1.2 | Create `backend/app/core/logging.py` with JSON formatter + `log_context` | F14 | ✅ |
| 1.3 | Create `backend/app/core/database.py` with async session factory | F14 | ✅ |
| 1.4 | Create `backend/app/middleware/request_id.py` (`RequestIdMiddleware`) | N3 | ✅ |
| 1.5 | Create `backend/app/main.py` with health endpoints (`/health`, `/health/live`, `/health/ready`) | N3 | ✅ |
| 1.6 | Create `backend/app/middleware/cors.py` | — | ✅ |
| 1.7 | Create `.env.example` listing every env var from CLAUDE.md §10.1 | F14 | ✅ |
| 1.8 | Create `Makefile` with setup, seed, ingest, backend, demo, test, lint targets | — | ✅ |
| 1.9 | Create `tests/conftest.py` with offline env vars + auth fixtures | — | |
| 1.10 | Create `tests/api/test_health.py` | N3 | |

**Exit criteria:** Health tests pass offline. `.env.example` lists every variable. `make test` passes.

