## Phase 3 — Identity and request guards (Requires: N1, N2, N6)

| ID | Task | PRD Rows | Status |
|----|------|----------|--------|
| 3.1 | Create `backend/app/core/security.py` (JWT HS256, `require_role`) | N1 | ✅ |
| 3.2 | Create auth router (`POST /auth/login`, `/auth/refresh`, `/auth/me`) | N1 | ✅ |
| 3.3 | Create `backend/app/middleware/rate_limit.py` | N2 | ✅ |
| 3.4 | Create `backend/app/middleware/audit.py` | N6 | ✅ |
| 3.5 | Create demo token issuer | N1 | ✅ |
| 3.6 | Verify middleware order: CORS → RequestId → RateLimit → Audit | N1–N6 | ✅ |
| 3.7 | Create `tests/api/` auth and RBAC tests (viewer 403 on mutating routes) | N1, N6 | |

**Exit criteria:** Missing/bad tokens rejected. `vic.viewer` gets 403 on mutating routes. Agent token accepted. Non-GET writes `audit_logs`. Limiter uses fakeredis.

