| 7.4 | Severity rules can raise but never lower model score | F3 | |
| 7.5 | Escalation rules match dispute, deletion, security, data loss, legal, enterprise outage | F10 | |
| 7.6 | CD-1013 flagged and wrapped as data | N4 | |
| 7.7 | Output validation rejects internal URLs, secrets, other customers' data; failure = risk high | N5 | |
| 7.8 | `scrub` removes card numbers, API keys, passwords | N7 | |
| 7.9 | Create `tests/unit/` guardrail tests | F3, N4, N5 | |

**Exit criteria:** Grey-area model judgement is only path left for Phase 8. Policy cases already have a decision.

