| 8.7 | Troubleshooting agent: probable causes + numbered steps | F7 | |
| 8.8 | Resolution agent: plan from `plan_actions`, grounded + validated reply | F8 | |
| 8.9 | Create `backend/app/schemas/workflow.py` | F2–F8 | |
