| ID | Task | PRD Rows | Status |
|----|------|----------|--------|
| 12.1 | Create `frontend/` Next.js 15 + Tailwind 3 | F12 | |
| 12.2 | Create `frontend/components/ui/` hand-written kit (no UI library, no gradients) | F12 | |
| 12.3 | Create `frontend/lib/{api,types,hooks,format,cn}.ts` | F12 | |
| 12.4 | Create `frontend/components/layout/{nav,AuthProvider,Shell}` | F12 | |
| 12.5 | Create pages: `/login`, `/dashboard`, `/tickets`, `/tickets/[id]`, `/customers`, `/customers/[id]`, `/knowledge`, `/escalations`, `/agents`, `/audit`, `/settings`, `/api/health` | F12 | |
| 12.6 | Create ticket workflow screen (`app/(dashboard)/tickets/[id]/page.tsx`) with three-column layout | F12 | |
| 12.7 | Create `components/ticket/{WorkflowSteps,WorkflowPanel,ApprovalBar,ReplyComposer}` | F12 | |
